WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.500
Nothing so far has needed an account.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.400
Without one, it is one report a day.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.100
The full report, with nothing removed or marked.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.100
A free account makes it one an hour, and keeps them.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.100
Past reports stay available to reopen.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.200
A dollar a month makes it five an hour.

7
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.100
The report itself is the same at all three levels.

8
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.400
Other ways to start is last.
